5,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Good morning, everyone. I believe it is prudent to ensure our chosen plan is sustainable in practice, not just on paper. I look forward to a productive discussion.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I agree. We should focus on the practicalities of implementation to avoid any unforeseen issues during the redevelopment process.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Mio,,I'm so excited to get started! I want to make sure we pick a plan that's actually great for the long run and doesn't cause any headaches later. Let's make this park amazing!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"I agree with the need for sustainability. However, we must be specific about what that means. I am particularly concerned with the long-term operational management and the actual manpower available for maintenance.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,"I agree with Asuka. We must ensure the plan aligns with the actual behavior of the land and the people who use it daily, rather than relying on an idealized vision.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Since we are all in agreement regarding practicality, perhaps we should examine the actual outcomes of previous projects. It would be a pity to be seduced by a beautiful drawing that cannot endure.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Misaki,,That is a valid point. I believe we should also look into the capacity of the local firms and the specific constraints of the site to ensure the timeline is realistic.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Mio,,"That sounds like a plan! I'm curious about how much we're actually spending on the park right now. If we want it to be sustainable, we should see where the money goes, right?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Mio, spending is one part of it, but the human element is just as critical. We need to know who is actually performing the work and whether we are relying too heavily on external contractors.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Asuka, I agree. To understand the reality of the site, we should examine the actual usage patterns and the environmental stresses the land faces throughout the year.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"It seems we have a comprehensive list of concerns. To avoid any ""architectural mirages,"" I shall focus on the tangible legacy of our previous efforts. I'll examine the condition of works from the earlier programme and the upkeep ledger.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I will look into the regional firms tendering for earth-moving and the depot phasing notes on hoarding the site. I want to ensure the construction timeline and local capacity are realistic.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Mio,,I'll go with the upkeep ledger spend per hectare and the groundskeeping roll and bought-in services! I really want to see how the costs and the staff balance out for the city.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"I will examine the groundskeeping roll and bought-in services, as well as the volunteer groups working with the division. I need to understand the actual labor structure supporting our public spaces.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minako,,I will look into the timed counts of weekday crossings and the drainage callouts and August heat readings. I want to see how the park actually functions under pressure.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"It appears we have a balanced distribution of research. I shall leave you all to your investigations, trusting that the data will speak more truthfully than any glossy brochure. I look forward to the findings.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I agree. Let us review the information we gather and discuss how it impacts the feasibility of the proposed plans. I look forward to seeing what we discover.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Mio,,I can't wait to see what we find! I'll be digging into those numbers to make sure we don't get any scary surprises later. See you all in the next round!,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I will focus on the labor data. It is essential to determine if the current staffing levels can realistically support a new redevelopment without further straining the existing rota. I look forward to the results.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Minako,,I will analyze the data on usage and environmental stress. It is essential that we base our decision on the physical reality of the site. I look forward to our next discussion.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
